| Cardamom CO2/absolute | Cardamom EO + Terpinyl Acetate + Jessemal + diluted Immortelle | Warm oily crushed-seed interior is less literal and EO remains more terpenic | **High** for the two-state cardamom realism | Purchase P1 only after current topology preserves identity/liking |
| Caraway EO | Clary Sage + Terpinyl Acetate + Immortelle | Historic aromatic seed shadow remains approximate; immortelle risks honey/curry drift | **Medium** | Purchase P2 after the warm handoff survives |
| Cinnamon Bark Oil (NYSUPPLY) botanical identity/physics/safety | No substitution; exact 10% row held | Supplier and bark are known, but strict OAV, composite-natural behavior, and material-specific safety cannot be adjudicated without species/lot/preparation documents | **High data gate**, not proof of high sensory impact | Photograph/transcribe botanical species, lot, exact stock preparation, and SDS/IFRA documents before physical testing |

The two missing odor materials do not block theoretical or partial computational evaluation. The NYSUPPLY cinnamon data gap blocks complete OAV/safety interpretation and the proposed physical blind protocol.

## Future mixing order — not executed

1. Resolve the NYSUPPLY cinnamon label HOLD and prepare/verify all working stocks.
2. Combine quiet matrix, EB, sandalwoods, pressure materials, cedar/vetiver, and allow full integration.
3. Add violet/root cloth and connective tissue.
4. Add coumarin/Tonkarome, heliotropal, damascenone, NYSUPPLY Cinnamon Bark Oil 10%, and warm-seed materials.
5. Add lavender/air materials, then cardamom and ester shell.
6. Add citrus, pepper, aldehydes, and beta-pinene stock last.
7. Bring concentrate to exactly 6,000 uL; add ethanol only under separately authorized compounding.

This is unexecuted process design, not observed solubility, maturation, or stability evidence.

## Controlled blinded topology test — future work / HOLD_LABEL

The physical test remains **HOLD** until the NYSUPPLY bark-oil botanical identity, 10% stock basis, and safety documents are resolved. Once resolved, keep the NYSUPPLY 10% stock at 30 uL constant in every arm so the test never confounds its presence with the two structural questions.

Protect the remaining identity core and test two non-overlapping detail blocks. Omitted blocks are replaced one-for-one with DPG:

- **SEED-HANDOFF+ (50 uL):** Damascenone 1% 20 uL + Beta Ionone 1% 20 uL + Immortelle Absolute 10% 10 uL. Tests dried-fruit/bruise/hayed-herbal continuity inside cardamom; curry, maple, or pastry drift rejects it.
- **TAILORED-RELIEF+ (30 uL):** Beta-Pinene 1% 10 uL + Dynascone 10% 10 uL + Orivone 10% 10 uL. Tests capsule edge, bitter-green tailoring, and iris-to-wood incision below thematic recognition.

| Arm | Common core | SEED-HANDOFF+ | TAILORED-RELIEF+ | DPG replacement | Total concentrate |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| A / 00 compressed control | 5920 | 0 | 0 | 80 | 6000 |
| B / 10 | 5920 | 50 | 0 | 30 | 6000 |
| C / 01 | 5920 | 0 | 30 | 50 | 6000 |
| D / 11 full V2 | 5920 | 50 | 30 | 0 | 6000 |

Prepare each full 6,000 uL concentrate master so every source aliquot meets the 10 uL floor, then take 600 uL concentrate + 2,400 uL ethanol for each coded 3 mL bottle. Make a second independent master set for confirmation. Randomize anonymous codes and use balanced serving orders; keep the key sealed until all ballots are locked.

Evaluate at 0, 5, 30, and 120 minutes, then 6 and 24 hours. Record free description first, then LNDL recognizability, cardamom shell, lavender continuity, warm crushed-seed plausibility, shell-to-seed handoff, cedar/vetiver identity, airy/dense simultaneity, tailored complexion, spatial depth, late identity echo, overall liking, muddiness, harshness, pastry/cinnamon-candy drift, lipstick-iris takeover, leather takeover, amberwood wall, and fatigue.

Identity loss rejects an arm before abstract depth. The full-detail arm survives only if it preserves LNDL identity and improves an identity-linked transition/depth axis without worsening liking or drift. A null or discordant result is `HOLD/NON-INFORMATIVE`, not proof that a material is universally dormant.

## Final claim ceiling

This artifact is **theory plus partial computational experiment design only**. It has not been physically compounded or smelled. No similarity, liking, luxury, complexity, depth, three-dimensionality, safety, stability, longevity, diffusion, maturation, or release claim is established. NYSUPPLY-cinnamon-dependent computational and safety conclusions remain on explicit HOLD.

**Pipeline sentinel override:** the formatter below prints the unmapped NYSUPPLY cinnamon row as `VP=0`, `ODT=0`, `OAV=0`, `sub-threshold`, and `[Structural (acceptable)]`. Those are missing-data sentinel artifacts, not measured or predicted physics. The cinnamon row is **UNKNOWN / HOLD**, cannot be classified as dormant, perceptible, or structurally acceptable, and is effectively omitted from all modeled OAV shares and temporal totals.

